    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index retreated to the lowest point since February at 6,356 points, down by 1,450 points week-on-week. There was a $1.40/t drop in the W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate to $9.75/t, while the round-voyage rate fell by $3,850/day to $11,650/day.",
